OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after 'knives and
OL,4,Aother weapons' seized from train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BTP spokesperson said the 38-year-old
OL,7,Fhad been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fpossession of bladed articles,
OL,9,Foffensive weapons, and culpable
OL,10,Freckless conduct.
